
Mavind — ultra-lightweight Windows-app OS

  mavind-wine install <file.exe>     install a Windows program
  mavind-wine list                   installed Windows programs
  mavind-system-monitor              real RAM / CPU / disk / processes
  mpk install <pkg>                  add an optional component
  mavind-settings                    system settings

Docs: /usr/share/doc is stripped by design — see github.com/mavind-os/mavind
